# CoreKG Open Source License

CoreKG is licensed under the Apache License 2.0, with the following additional conditions. The English text is authoritative; the Chinese text is provided for reference only.

CoreKG 依据 Apache License 2.0 授权，并附加以下补充条件。英文文本具有法律效力，中文文本仅供参考。

---

## 1. Commercial Use / 商业化使用

CoreKG is permitted to be used for commercialization. You may use CoreKG as a "backend-as-a-service" for other applications or deliver it to enterprises as an application development platform, provided that you comply with section 2 when engaging in the commercial use described there.

CoreKG 允许被用于商业化。您可以将 CoreKG 作为其他应用的"后端即服务"，或作为应用开发平台交付给企业。但当涉及第 2 条所述商业化情形时，您必须遵守第 2 条的要求。

## 2. Conditions Requiring a Commercial License / 需取得商业许可的情形

When any of the following conditions is met, you must contact the CoreKG maintainers to obtain a commercial license:

满足以下任一条件时，您必须联系 CoreKG 维护者取得商业许可：

### a. Multi-tenant SaaS Service / 多租户 SaaS 服务

Unless explicitly authorized by the CoreKG maintainers in writing, you may not use the CoreKG source code to operate a multi-tenant SaaS service that is similar to CoreKG.

除非经 CoreKG 维护者书面明确授权，您不得使用 CoreKG 源代码运营与 CoreKG 相似的多租户 SaaS 服务。

### b. Knowledge Graph / 知识图谱

The knowledge graph features — including but not limited to graph schema, node and edge management, graph construction tasks, and graph-based RAG search — are reserved for commercial licensing. Any commercial or profit-making use of these features, including without limitation operating a SaaS business built on them, offering them as paid services, or deploying them for paid enterprise delivery, requires a commercial license from the CoreKG maintainers. Non-commercial use of the knowledge graph features remains governed by this License.

知识图谱功能——包括但不限于图谱 Schema、节点与边管理、图谱构建任务、基于图谱的 RAG 搜索——为商业授权保留功能。任何对上述功能的商业化或获利性使用，包括但不限于基于它们运营 SaaS 业务、将其作为付费服务提供，或为付费的企业交付进行部署，均需取得 CoreKG 维护者的商业许可。知识图谱功能的非商业性使用仍受本许可证约束。

### c. OFD Document Support / OFD 文档支持

The OFD document support features — including but not limited to OFD document upload, preview, parsing, and OFD-to-PDF conversion — are reserved for commercial licensing. Any commercial or profit-making use of these features, including without limitation operating a SaaS business built on them, offering them as paid services, or deploying them for paid enterprise delivery, requires a commercial license from the CoreKG maintainers. Non-commercial use of the OFD document support features remains governed by this License.

OFD 文档支持功能——包括但不限于 OFD 文档上传、预览、解析、OFD 转 PDF——为商业授权保留功能。任何对上述功能的商业化或获利性使用，包括但不限于基于它们运营 SaaS 业务、将其作为付费服务提供，或为付费的企业交付进行部署，均需取得 CoreKG 维护者的商业许可。OFD 文档支持功能的非商业性使用仍受本许可证约束。

### d. Logo and Copyright Information / Logo 与版权信息

When using CoreKG, you may not remove or modify the CoreKG logo or copyright information displayed in the CoreKG console.

使用 CoreKG 时，您不得移除或修改 CoreKG 控制台中展示的 CoreKG logo 或版权信息。

对于商业许可事宜，请通过仓库的 GitHub Issues（https://github.com/insmtx/CoreKG/issues）联系 CoreKG 维护者。

Please contact the CoreKG maintainers for commercial licensing matters through the repository's GitHub Issues at https://github.com/insmtx/CoreKG/issues.

## 3. Contributor Terms / 贡献者条款

As a contributor, you agree that your contributed code:

作为贡献者，您同意您贡献的代码：

a. May be licensed under open-source terms that the producer adjusts to be more strict or more relaxed.

a. 可能依据生产者调整为更严格或更宽松的开源条款进行授权。

b. May be used for commercial purposes, including CoreKG's cloud business.

b. 可能被用于商业用途，包括 CoreKG 的云业务。

